      nclexTraps: ["Inflammatory-disease methotrexate is commonly once weekly, not once daily. Daily dosing is a medical emergency risk even when each tablet is small.", "Leucovorin is used for selected toxicity or high-dose rescue; routine folic acid supplementation is not the same intervention."],
