      nclexTraps: ["Apremilast is a PDE4 inhibitor, not a biologic cytokine antibody and not a JAK inhibitor; routine TB screening is not its defining safety step.", "Titration prevents early GI intolerance; it does not mean the maintenance dose should stay at a starter-pack level."],
