      interactions: ["Azathioprine and mercaptopurine are contraindicated; theophylline and other xanthine-oxidase substrates require current-label review.", "Review hepatotoxic medicines and cardiovascular therapies; interaction absence does not remove the boxed cardiovascular-risk comparison with allopurinol."],
