      nclexTraps: ["Febuxostat is not the routine first choice before an adequate allopurinol trial because of its boxed cardiovascular-death warning.", "A flare after starting febuxostat reflects crystal mobilization, not increased urate production; continue urate lowering and treat inflammation unless another safety issue requires stopping."],
